Vey squares the ledger against the counter edge. "Because you asked, not offered," she says. "Fine. I'll be your ear on this dock." She tears a corner from a page, writes a string of digits, and slides it across. "Stall's open every shift. Pay in water or news." A shadow crosses the queue behind you, and she turns the ledger shut.

