The *Kobayashi IV* slides into Bleakhold Station's dock ring ahead of anything that might have followed. Clamps seat with a clean thud. The corporate bay is bright, orderly, and nearly empty. A customs clerk in a gray vest waves your hold through without opening it, then glances once at the cargo manifest on her panel. Her thumb hovers over a button. She looks up. <npc>"Name on the registry doesn't match the berth request,"</npc> she says. <npc>"Which one is true?"</npc>

